title: Friedrich Stamper
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor
card-image: img/portraits/StampferFriedrich.jpg
view-if: stampfer_advisor = 1
new-page: true 

= Friedrich Stamper

Friedrich Stamper is the long-time editor-in-chief of Vorwärts, our party newspaper, and also a Assembly member. He was historically part of the Majority <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> that supported our participation in the Great War, but also supports cooperation with the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> to save the Republic. 

[? if collectivist_truce: Since such a SPD-KPD cooperation can be considered achieved through a truce with the Vanguard, Stamper is emboldened to direct Vorwärts fully towards placating internal dissent by supporting a Center position. ?]

- @media_
- @faction_support_
- @kpd_cooperation
- @root: Return to main


@media_
title: Media
subtitle: Manage our party's newspapers and media.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; media_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: media


@faction_support_
title: Editorial Line
subtitle: We can change the editorial line of Vorwärts to support a particular faction.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6

Which faction should we support?

- @support_left: Left
- @support_center: Center
- @support_labor: Labor
- @support_reform: Reformists
- @support_neorev: Neorevisionists

@support_left
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 8; left_strength += 8; editorial_line = "Left"

Vorwärts prints editorials in support of Left positions.

@support_center
on-arrival: center_dissent -= 8; center_strength += 8; editorial_line = "Center"

Vorwärts prints editorials in support of centrist positions.

@support_labor
on-arrival: labor_dissent -= 8; labor_strength += 8; editorial_line = "Labor"

Vorwärts prints editorials in support of the policies of the Free Guilds.

@support_reform
on-arrival: reformist_dissent -= 8; reformist_strength += 8; editorial_line = "Reformists"

Vorwärts prints editorials in support of the reformist policies.

@support_neorev
view-if: neorevisionism
on-arrival: knight_dissent -= 8; knight_strength += 8; editorial_line = "Neorevisionists"; royalist_urgency += 1

Vorwärts prints editorials in support of neorevisionist ideas.

@kpd_cooperation
title: Cooperation with the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>
subtitle: Could we build closer ties with the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>?
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 2; collectivist_relation += 4*(1-dissent); reformist_dissent += 2

Stamper works towards closer ties with the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> through our media.
